<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Flock Training Log</title>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#101E22">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Flock">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml;base64,">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="data:image/svg+xml;base64,">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,600;12..96,800&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --seed:#101E22;      /* page */
    --paper:#182C31;     /* panels */
    --raise:#1F3A40;     /* inputs */
    --ink:#F0E7D8;       /* text */
    --soft:#93A9A6;      /* muted text */
    --line:#2C474D;
    --crimson:#F2496B;
    --cobalt:#5AB6D6;
    --olive:#8FD46A;
    --gold:#F0A93C;
    --radius:10px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--seed);
    background-image:radial-gradient(120% 60% at 50% 0%, #1A3239 0%, #101E22 62%);
    background-attachment:fixed;
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:"Instrument Sans",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;
    font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:840px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 80px}

  /* ---- masthead ---- */
  header.mast{margin-bottom:20px}
  h1{
    font-family:"Bricolage Grotesque",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;
    font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(34px,10vw,58px);line-height:.92;
    margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:-0.035em;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  h1::after{
    content:"";display:block;width:56px;height:5px;margin-top:12px;
    background:var(--gold);border-radius:3px;
  }
  .mast p{margin:10px 0 0;color:var(--soft);font-size:14px;max-width:52ch}
  .tally{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;margin-top:18px;
    background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;
  }
  .tally div{background:var(--paper);padding:11px 10px;font-size:11px;color:var(--soft);
    text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;line-height:1.25}
  .tally b{
    display:block;font-family:"Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;font-weight:800;
    font-size:27px;color:var(--gold);line-height:1;margin-bottom:5px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;
  }

  /* ---- nav ---- */
  nav{display:flex;gap:5px;margin:20px 0 18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  nav button{
    font-family:inherit;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;
    background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--soft);
    padding:8px 14px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;
  }
  nav button[aria-selected="true"]{background:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold);color:#14232A}

  /* ---- perch row ---- */
  .perch{display:flex;gap:8px;overflow-x:auto;padding:2px 0 14px;scrollbar-width:thin}
  .bird{
    flex:0 0 auto;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:var(--radius);padding:11px 14px;cursor:pointer;
    min-width:118px;text-align:left;font-family:inherit;color:var(--ink);
    border-left:3px solid var(--line);
  }
  .bird[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--raise);border-color:var(--line)}
  .bird .dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:7px}
  .bird .nm{display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;line-height:1.2}
  .bird .sp{display:block;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--soft);margin-top:2px}
  .bird .pct{display:block;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--gold);margin-top:6px;font-weight:600}
  .addbird{
    flex:0 0 auto;background:none;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);
    color:var(--soft);font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;padding:10px 14px;min-width:96px;
  }

  /* ---- bird head ---- */
  .birdhead{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin:18px 0 4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .birdhead h2{
    font-family:"Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;font-weight:800;
    font-size:29px;margin:0;letter-spacing:-0.03em;
  }
  .birdhead .sub{color:var(--soft);font-size:13.5px}
  .minibtn{
    background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;
    font-family:inherit;font-size:12px;color:var(--soft);padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .bar{height:4px;background:var(--line);border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden;margin:12px 0 20px}
  .bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--olive),var(--gold))}

  /* ---- skill groups ---- */
  .group{margin-bottom:26px}
  .group h3{
    font-family:"Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;
    margin:0 0 3px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--gold);
  }
  .group .blurb{font-size:13px;color:var(--soft);margin:0 0 11px;max-width:56ch}
  .skill{
    background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:6px;border-left:3px solid var(--line);
  }
  .skill.done{border-left-color:var(--olive);background:#1A322C}
  .skilltop{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between}
  .skillname{font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;flex:1;line-height:1.3}
  .stage{
    font-family:inherit;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;
    text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;
    border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--raise);color:var(--soft);
    border-radius:7px;padding:5px 10px;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .stage[data-s="1"]{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold)}
  .stage[data-s="2"]{border-color:var(--cobalt);color:var(--cobalt)}
  .stage[data-s="3"]{background:var(--olive);border-color:var(--olive);color:#122A20}
  .undo{background:none;border:none;color:var(--soft);font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:4px 2px}
  .how{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--soft);margin:9px 0 0;display:none;max-width:60ch}
  .skill.open .how{display:block}

  /* ---- cards + forms ---- */
  .card{
    background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:15px;margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  label{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--soft);margin:0 0 5px;
    text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;font-weight:600}
  input[type=text],input[type=number],textarea,select{
    width:100%;font-family:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);
    background:var(--raise);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;
    padding:10px;margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  textarea{min-height:66px;resize:vertical}
  .primary{
    font-family:inherit;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;
    background:var(--gold);color:#14232A;border:none;border-radius:8px;
    padding:11px 20px;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .ghost{
    font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;background:none;color:var(--soft);
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 16px;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .row{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .chips{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:12px}
  .chip{
    font-family:inherit;font-size:12.5px;background:var(--raise);
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;padding:6px 11px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--soft);
  }
  .chip[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--cobalt);border-color:var(--cobalt);color:#0E2229;font-weight:600}

  .entry{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px 0}
  .entry:last-child{border-bottom:none}
  .entry .meta{font-size:12px;color:var(--soft)}
  .entry .who{font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px}
  .entry .body{font-size:14px;margin-top:4px;color:var(--soft)}
  .entry .del{float:right;background:none;border:none;color:var(--soft);cursor:pointer;font-size:12.5px}

  /* ---- timer ---- */
  .timerbar{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;
    background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--cobalt);
    border-radius:var(--radius);padding:12px 14px;margin:12px 0 4px;
  }
  .tclock{
    font-family:"Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;
    letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--ink);min-width:88px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
  }
  .timerbar.running .tclock{color:var(--cobalt)}
  .timerbar.done .tclock{color:var(--olive)}
  .tnote{font-size:12px;color:var(--soft);flex:1;min-width:180px}

  /* ---- weight ---- */
  .wtop{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .wnow{font-family:"Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.03em}
  .wnow small{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--soft);margin-left:3px}
  .wmeta{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--soft)}
  .wflag{
    font-size:13px;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 11px;margin-top:10px;
    background:#3A2418;border:1px solid #7A4A28;color:#F0B47C;
  }
  .wflag.low{background:#3E1A22;border-color:#8A3145;color:#F49AAC}
  .wrow{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-end;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .wrow input{margin-bottom:0;flex:1;min-width:110px}
  .whist{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:10px}
  .wchip{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--soft);background:var(--raise);border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px}
  .wchip b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}

  /* ---- treats ---- */
  .treat{
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;
    background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:var(--radius);padding:11px 14px;margin-bottom:6px;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .treat[data-t="1"]{border-left-color:#6E5A5A;opacity:.62}
  .treat[data-t="2"]{border-left-color:var(--cobalt)}
  .treat[data-t="3"]{border-left-color:var(--gold);background:#2A2818}
  .treat .t{font-weight:600;font-size:15px}
  .treat .h{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--soft);margin-top:2px;max-width:46ch}
  .treat .badge{
    font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;padding:5px 9px;color:var(--soft);
    white-space:nowrap;background:var(--raise);
  }
  .treat[data-t="2"] .badge{border-color:var(--cobalt);color:var(--cobalt)}
  .treat[data-t="3"] .badge{background:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold);color:#14232A}
  .treat .x{background:none;border:none;color:var(--soft);cursor:pointer;font-size:12.5px;padding:2px 4px}

  /* ---- words ---- */
  .word{
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;
    background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--crimson);
    border-radius:var(--radius);padding:11px 14px;margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .word.said{border-left-color:var(--olive);background:#1A322C}
  .word .t{font-weight:600;font-size:15px}
  .word .cue{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--soft);margin-top:2px}

  /* ---- today ---- */
  .plan{
    background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius:var(--radius);padding:13px 15px;margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  .plan .who{font-weight:700;font-size:15.5px}
  .plan .what{font-size:14px;color:var(--soft);margin-top:4px;max-width:62ch}
  .plan .what b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
  .plan.recap{border-left-color:var(--cobalt)}
  .plan.done{border-left-color:var(--olive);background:#1A322C}
  .todaybar{
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:12px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:4px;
  }
  .tdate{font-family:"Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
  .tcount{font-size:13px;color:var(--gold);margin-top:2px}
  .mins{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:11px;color:var(--soft);
    text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}
  .minopt{
    font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;width:33px;height:33px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper);color:var(--soft);
    border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .minopt[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--cobalt);border-color:var(--cobalt);color:#0E2229}
  .planacts{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:11px;align-items:center}
  .act{
    font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;
    background:var(--gold);color:#14232A;border:none;border-radius:8px;
    padding:8px 15px;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .act.sec{background:none;color:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:500}
  .checkmark{color:var(--olive);font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px}

  /* ---- reference ---- */
  .ref h3{font-family:"Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;font-size:13px;margin:26px 0 8px;
    font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--gold)}
  .ref p{font-size:14.5px;margin:0 0 10px;max-width:64ch;color:var(--ink)}
  .ref ul{margin:0 0 14px;padding-left:19px;font-size:14.5px;max-width:64ch}
  .ref li{margin-bottom:7px}
  .ref li b{color:var(--gold);font-weight:600}
  .src{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--soft);font-style:italic}

  .secline{
    font-family:"Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;
    margin:6px 0 11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--gold);
  }
  .secline:not(:first-child){margin-top:30px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .empty{color:var(--soft);font-size:14px;padding:14px 0}
  .hide{display:none}
  .note{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--soft);margin-top:14px;max-width:60ch}
  ::-webkit-scrollbar{height:6px}
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--line);border-radius:3px}
  ::placeholder{color:#6C8582}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){
    .bar i{transition:width .35s ease}
  }
  button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{
    outline:2px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:2px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <header class="mast">
    <h1>Flock Training Log</h1>
    <p>Short sessions, one bird at a time, every skill built on the last. <span style="opacity:.6">Build 8</span></p>
    <div class="tally">
      <div><b id="tSess">0</b>sessions logged</div>
      <div><b id="tWeek">0</b>this week</div>
      <div><b id="tSolid">0</b>skills solid</div>
      <div><b id="tMin">0</b>minutes total</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <nav id="nav">
    <button data-tab="today" aria-selected="true">Today</button>
    <button data-tab="birds" aria-selected="false">Birds</button>
    <button data-tab="log" aria-selected="false">Log</button>
    <button data-tab="treats" aria-selected="false">Treats &amp; tunes</button>
    <button data-tab="words" aria-selected="false">Words</button>
    <button data-tab="ref" aria-selected="false">How it works</button>
  </nav>

  <!-- TODAY -->
  <section id="tab-today">
    <div class="todaybar">
      <div>
        <div class="tdate" id="tdDate"></div>
        <div class="tcount" id="tdCount"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="mins">
        <span>Session length</span>
        <button class="minopt" data-min="3">3</button>
        <button class="minopt" data-min="5">5</button>
        <button class="minopt" data-min="10">10</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="timerbar" id="timerBar">
      <div class="tclock" id="tClock">0:00</div>
      <button class="act" id="tStart">Start timer</button>
      <button class="act sec" id="tStop">Reset</button>
      <span class="tnote" id="tNote">Runs for your chosen session length, then chimes. Keep both hands on the bird.</span>
    </div>

    <h4 class="secline">Work on next</h4>
    <div id="planList"></div>

    <h4 class="secline">Keep it sharp</h4>
    <div id="recapList"></div>
    <p class="note">Anything at Coming along or better that has sat untouched for 12 days resurfaces here. Ask for it cold, once, and pay well.</p>

    <h4 class="secline">Logged today</h4>
    <div id="todayLog"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- BIRDS -->
  <section id="tab-birds" class="hide">
    <div class="perch" id="perch"></div>
    <div class="birdhead">
      <h2 id="bName">—</h2>
      <span class="sub" id="bSpecies"></span>
      <button class="minibtn" id="renameBtn">Rename</button>
      <button class="minibtn" id="removeBtn">Remove</button>
    </div>
    <div class="card hide" id="editPanel"></div>
    <div class="bar"><i id="bBar" style="width:0%"></i></div>
    <div class="card" id="weightCard"></div>
    <div id="skillArea"></div>
    <div class="card">
      <label for="csName">Add your own skill for this bird</label>
      <input type="text" id="csName" placeholder="Step onto the scale from the shower perch">
      <label for="csHow">How you will teach it (optional)</label>
      <input type="text" id="csHow" placeholder="Target across, mark the second both feet land">
      <button class="primary" id="csAdd">Add skill</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- LOG -->
  <section id="tab-log" class="hide">
    <div class="card">
      <label for="lgBird">Who trained</label>
      <select id="lgBird"></select>
      <label for="lgMin">Minutes</label>
      <input type="number" id="lgMin" min="1" max="120" value="5">
      <label>What you worked on</label>
      <div class="chips" id="lgSkills"></div>
      <label for="lgNote">How it went</label>
      <textarea id="lgNote" placeholder="Took the target three times, lost interest after that."></textarea>
      <button class="primary" id="lgSave">Save session</button>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <label>Show sessions for</label>
      <div class="chips" id="histFilter"></div>
      <div id="history"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TREATS -->
  <section id="tab-treats" class="hide">
    <div class="perch" id="tperch"></div>
    <h4 class="secline" id="tHead">Treats</h4>
    <div id="treatList"></div>
    <div class="card">
      <label for="ctName">Add your own</label>
      <input type="text" id="ctName" placeholder="Scrambled egg crumb">
      <button class="primary" id="ctAdd">Add treat</button>
    </div>
    <p class="note">Tap a treat to cycle it: Untried, No thanks, Likes it, Jackpot. Keep every piece pea-sized or smaller and count them into the day's food. Reserve the Jackpot tier for the hard asks \u2014 harness, towel, a scary new step \u2014 so it keeps its power.</p>

    <h4 class="secline" id="mHead">Music</h4>
    <div id="musicList"></div>
    <div class="card">
      <label for="cmName">Add a station or playlist</label>
      <input type="text" id="cmName" placeholder="Sublime radio">
      <button class="primary" id="cmAdd">Add station</button>
    </div>
    <p class="note">Same four taps: Untried, No reaction, Likes it, Favorite. Read her rather than the playlist \u2014 singing along, relaxed eye pinning, or fluffing up and preening means yes; going silent, turning away, or leaving the perch means no. Give each station a couple of separate sessions before you judge it. Keep the volume at conversational level and run a few hours a day, not all day.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- WORDS -->
  <section id="tab-words" class="hide">
    <div class="card">
      <label for="wBird">Talker</label>
      <select id="wBird"></select>
      <label for="wText">Phrase</label>
      <input type="text" id="wText" placeholder="Uh oh, spaghetti-o">
      <label for="wCue">When you say it</label>
      <input type="text" id="wCue" placeholder="Any time something drops or crashes">
      <button class="primary" id="wAdd">Add phrase</button>
    </div>
    <div id="wordList"></div>
    <p class="note">Tap a phrase to mark it learned. One phrase at a time, same wording, same trigger, same emotion — that consistency is what makes it stick.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- REFERENCE -->
  <section id="tab-ref" class="hide ref">
    <h3>The method both books share</h3>
    <p>Everything here runs on positive reinforcement. You never punish, never grab, never force. You wait for the behavior you want, mark the exact instant it happens, and pay for it. The bird stays in charge of whether to participate, which is precisely why it works on a standoffish bird.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><b>The marker.</b> A clicker or a short word said the same way every time. It means "that, right there, earned you something." Charge it first by clicking and treating twenty times with nothing asked.</li>
      <li><b>Target training first.</b> Teaching a bird to touch a stick with its beak is the master key. It moves the bird around without hands, becomes the building block for step up, recall, stationing, scales, and carriers, and gives a nervous bird a job.</li>
      <li><b>Small approximations.</b> Reward the first flinch toward the behavior, not the finished trick. Split any step the bird fails twice into two easier steps.</li>
      <li><b>Short and frequent.</b> Three to five minutes, two or three times a day. Stop while the bird still wants more.</li>
      <li><b>End on a win.</b> Always finish with something easy the bird already knows.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Where the two differ</h3>
    <p>Sazhin's book is the more systematic one — it treats training as a whole management program, with a lot of attention to motivation. His central claim is that a bird that gets unlimited food from a bowl all day has no reason to work with you, so he uses careful body-weight monitoring and delivers a share of the daily food through training instead. Done properly this is a routine falconry practice; done carelessly it is dangerous, so if you go that route, use a gram scale daily and set a floor weight with an avian vet first.</p>
    <p>O'Connor's book is gentler and more trick-focused, with step-by-step recipes for individual behaviors and a strong emphasis on reading body language and building trust before asking for anything. It's the friendlier starting point.</p>
    <p class="src">Michael Sazhin, The Parrot Wizard's Guide to Well-Behaved Parrots · Rebecca K. O'Connor, The Perfectly Trained Parrot</p>

    <h3>House rules for your flock</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Train one bird at a time, out of sight of the others. An audience gets frustrated and a jealous conure will fly over and shove the macaw off the stick.</li>
      <li>Find each bird's high-value treat and reserve it for training only. Pine nut, sunflower seed, a single millet strand.</li>
      <li>Never end a session because the bird bit or fled. Drop to something easy, get one success, then stop.</li>
      <li>Husbandry behaviors — scale, towel, carrier, foot, wing — are worth more than any trick. Build them before you need them.</li>
      <li>Log it. Two lines after each session tells you in a month what is actually working.</li>
    </ul>
